    "citation": "Іваніна А. 2019. Палінологічна характеристика середньопалеозойських відкладів Волино-Поділля. Вісник Львівського університету. Серія геологічна, 33: 47–59.",
    "language": "Ukrainian; English abstract",
    "reports_window_spores": true,
    "comment": "Regional synthesis without sample identifiers, depths, coordinates or specimen illustrations. Early Devonian occurrences are reported at genus level. The Dniester Series list combines Emsian and Eifelian records and cannot be restricted to the Emsian; the paper calls both stages Lower Devonian. Ambitisporites is reported separately for the Lower Devonian without allocation to either series. Earlier studies by Shepeleva (1963), Partyka (1971), Lomaeva (1976) and Burova (1978) are cited, but reuse of particular assemblages is not specified. Tables 1–2 list taxa across the entire Devonian–Carboniferous succession without stage-specific assignments."
